# Patch:        020-trait-default-for-impl-def
# Phase:        post
# Target:       extraction/P3Matrix/Extraction/Funs.lean
# Hunks:        3
# Class:        reshape
# Gap:          docs/extractor-issues.md 21 (`impl_def` unfolds only
#               `@[trait_default]` functions, and a default reaches the
#               instance through a closure's `FnOnce` instance or a function).
# Cost:         none: the attribute only lets `impl_def` unfold the definition.
# Upstreamable: yes: aeneas could mark the closure instances and callees of a
#               default `@[trait_default]`.
# Drop when:    aeneas marks them, or `impl_def` unfolds through them.
#
# The safe read's default calls the unchecked read inside a closure.
#
# That closure's call instance takes the matrix impl.
#
# The strided view's default calls a constructor that also takes the impl.
#
# The recursive impl cannot resolve itself through either, and every matrix impl fails.
#
# Marking the three definitions as trait defaults lets it unfold them, and changes no definition.
#
